        <mxCell id="d_pgnote" value="Cardinalities (from FKs / unique constraints):&#xa;Organization 1—N Project 1—N MemoryDomain.&#xa;MemoryDomain 1—N ScopeDefinition · 1—N ProfileSchema · 1—N PreferenceDefinition   (all 1:N — the wizard makes one each by convention).&#xa;ProfileSchema 1—N ProfileSchemaVersion (one ACTIVE); a version binds ONE ScopeDefinition and maps N preferences.&#xa;RegisteredAgent N—1 MemoryDomain (home) · N—M ProfileSchema via AgentSchemaGrant.&#xa;ResolutionPolicy is AGENT-scoped with a DOMAIN-level default; it is never schema-owned." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F5FBF3;strokeColor=#82B366;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
